    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>StarFront: Heroes</strong> is an action space shooter.  You take control of a wing of three Heroes to take part in intense and challenging dogfights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For now there will be just three game-modes, but I plan to add more:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>STORY CAMPAIGN</strong>: Space Opera Story Campaign.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ROGUE-LIKE MODE:</strong> Travel throughout the solar system encountering ever increasing challenges.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ENDLESS ARENA:</strong>\u00a0Test your skills against infinite waves of enemies to climb the global leader-boards.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HERO COLLECTOR:</strong> Each ship is tied to a unique character unlocked through gameplay. They can be levelled up, modified, and customised with new weaponry and equipment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coming soon, please wishlist!\u00a0</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>StarFront: Heroes</strong> is an action space shooter.  You take control of a wing of three Heroes to take part in intense and challenging dogfights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For now there will be just three game-modes, but I plan to add more:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>STORY CAMPAIGN</strong>: Space Opera Story Campaign.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ROGUE-LIKE MODE:</strong> Travel throughout the solar system encountering ever increasing challenges.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ENDLESS ARENA:</strong>\u00a0Test your skills against infinite waves of enemies to climb the global leader-boards.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HERO COLLECTOR:</strong> Each ship is tied to a unique character unlocked through gameplay. They can be levelled up, modified, and customised with new weaponry and equipment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coming soon, please wishlist!\u00a0</p>",
